# APP
# Miscellaneous
APPLICATION/*.class
APPLICATION/*.log
APPLICATION/*.pyc
APPLICATION/*.swp
APPLICATION/.DS_Store
APPLICATION/.atom/
APPLICATION/.buildlog/
APPLICATION/.history
